[Icon Theme]
Name=Nothing
Comment=Monochrome Nothing places, devices, mimetypes and app icons on top of Papirus-Dark
Inherits=Papirus-Dark,breeze-dark,hicolor
Example=folder
Directories=scalable/places,48/apps,scalable/apps,22/apps,16/places,22/places,scalable/devices,22/devices,16/devices,scalable/mimetypes,22/mimetypes,16/mimetypes

[scalable/places]
